{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-notepad#card-zh","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-notepad","commit":"ebc43b9a60a75c6d6e7646f6b4ac5c0dfbdc888e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notepad 是面向 DSH 网页会话的工作区共享分段记事本浮窗。它把笔记保存到当前工作区，并可在设置页调整外观、保存方式和快捷键。用户可以拆分、排序、归档和合并分段，插入或发送内容到会话，粘贴图片，使用当前默认模型改写文字，也可将笔记移入独立窗口。适合需要在不同会话间保留工作区草稿并整理待办内容的 DSH 用户。使用前需要安装 DSH 网页版插件；AI 改写需要已配置默认模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:680","client.js:2727","client.js:4862","client.js:5033","client.js:4582"]}
{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-notepad#card-en","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-notepad","commit":"ebc43b9a60a75c6d6e7646f6b4ac5c0dfbdc888e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-notepad is a per-workspace notepad overlay for DSH web sessions. It saves segmented notes, supports sorting, archiving, session insertion and sending, image attachments, and AI rewriting with the configured default model. Notes can also open in a detached window. Install it in DSH web.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:680","client.js:2727","client.js:4862","client.js:5033","client.js:4582"]}
