{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-notepad#feature-1","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-notepad","commit":"ebc43b9a60a75c6d6e7646f6b4ac5c0dfbdc888e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notepad 的功能「工作区分段笔记」：在 DSH 会话浮窗中按段编辑和保存笔记，同一工作区的会话读取同一份内容。编辑后可自动保存，也可在手动保存模式下点击保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2727","client.js:3494","client.js:3519"]}
{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-notepad#feature-2","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-notepad","commit":"ebc43b9a60a75c6d6e7646f6b4ac5c0dfbdc888e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notepad 的功能「会话插入与归档」：通过分段工具栏可将笔记插入或替换当前对话框内容，也能发送分段；归档操作可整理已处理的内容，成功的对话发送还可自动记入工作区归档。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:4862","client.js:5033","client.js:1681","client.js:5288"]}
{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-notepad#feature-3","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-notepad","commit":"ebc43b9a60a75c6d6e7646f6b4ac5c0dfbdc888e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notepad 的功能「图片附件」：可在分段编辑区粘贴或选择图片，并在笔记中查看缩略图和预览；粘贴图片保存到工作区的插件图片目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:4046","client.js:4157","lib/image-store.js:188"]}
{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-notepad#feature-4","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-notepad","commit":"ebc43b9a60a75c6d6e7646f6b4ac5c0dfbdc888e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notepad 的功能「AI 改写」：在分段操作中触发优化，将所选文字发送给 DSH 当前默认模型并把结果放回笔记；没有配置默认模型时此功能不可用。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:4582","client.js:2253","index.js:323"]}
{"unit_id":"RestRegular__dsh-notepad#feature-5","repo":"RestRegular/dsh-notepad","commit":"ebc43b9a60a75c6d6e7646f6b4ac5c0dfbdc888e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notepad 的功能「独立窗口」：点击浮窗或设置页中的独立窗口操作，可将当前工作区的笔记在独立窗口打开；可用浏览器缺失时会回退到系统浏览器窗口。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:498","index.js:509","client.js:2280"]}
